Package: noderampart
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: NodeRampart maintainers <noreply@github.com>
Depends: systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), passwd, tzdata, ca-certificates, util-linux
Description: Security monitoring and traffic reporting agent for Linux VPS hosts
